@* Client/Shared/Components/HeroTitle.razor: a page's title in the brand colour and its description. The original's
   MudText Typo.h5 rendered an h5 as the page's only heading; the title is the page's h1 here, in the h5's size
   (Typography ties the element to the size, B24). *@

<div class="bh-hero-title">
    <h1 class="bh-hero-title__title">@title</h1>
    <p class="bh-hero-title__description">@description</p>
</div>

@code {
    @Parameter() title = "";
    @Parameter() description = "";
}
